 - Duetting, Guruganesh, Schneider, and Wang (ICML/PMLR 2023) is now verified. It studies one-sided Lipschitz maximization, motivated by pricing/contract design, and gives very small regret in that setting. Potential tool for threshold reward geometry and improved discretization, but delayed/adversarial time variation may block direct application.
