working_notes/iteration_summaries.md:9:Refuted/weakened: \(\beta\)-necessity, \(\gamma\)-necessity, and \(\Delta_T\)-necessity all fail or are unproved for process-aware instance-level learnability. Comparator `max` is also unsafe under strict crossing; use `sup`.
